  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "McKiernan is my pick when I want **brunch-lunch energy** in Montreal: big room, lots of light, and food that feels like a treat without requiring a whole “special occasion” plan. It’s the kind of place you go, drink coffee, eat something comforting, and then walk it off along the canal."
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "McKiernan"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Location:** Sud-Ouest (Lachine Canal), Montreal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Price Range:**  $$-$$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Cuisine:** Rotisserie / Quebec comfort food (with brunch + daytime classics)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Dress Code:** Casual"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "icon": "📖",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Quick Verdict:**"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Best For: Brunch dates, daytime catch-ups, out-of-town visitors",
        "Conversation Friendly: 4/5 (still lively, but easier in the day)",
        "Ambiance: Big-room, airy, industrial-warm",
        "Reservation: Nice to have on weekends",
        "**Brunch Score: 8/10**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Vibe"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "McKiernan sits in an industrial-feeling space right by the canal, and it leans into that: high ceilings, lots of light, and a “come as you are” room that still feels like a destination."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Lighting:** Bright and warm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Noise Level:** Lively, but not overwhelming in the daytime"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Best Seats:** Anywhere works, but edges of the room feel calmer if you want to linger"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What I Ordered (and why it slapped)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Devilled Brussels Sprouts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crispy-edged, salty-sweet, and the kind of “vegetable side” that disappears first. Enough punch and richness that it eats like bar food in the best way."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://file.notion.so/f/f/b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5/14925b39-ba9c-40fb-b743-811657d82b8e/DSCF3689.jpg?table=block&id=319c3484-e8de-8020-b4aa-c220e259d162&spaceId=b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5&expirationTimestamp=1783512000000&signature=yjiL2yoGy55ZRoqQFt61lK39m_tHgZ6oJJmpQEmRaW8",
      "caption": null,
      "localPath": "src/assets/images/reviews/mckiernan-brunch-review-lachine-canal-s-big-lively-daytime-hang.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Zesty Italian Beef Tartare"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bright, lemony, and clean-tasting. Not heavy or bluntly beefy. More “fresh and snackable”"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://file.notion.so/f/f/b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5/7c0e5d13-737a-45e9-b888-da78f88c2549/DSCF3686.jpg?table=block&id=319c3484-e8de-80a9-978c-d1aff85d3cbd&spaceId=b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5&expirationTimestamp=1783512000000&signature=IyS4p0i2hLypsTTh5y2XTICfEcx-hPdhNs4OFwEk_PU",
      "caption": null,
      "localPath": "src/assets/images/reviews/mckiernan-brunch-review-lachine-canal-s-big-lively-daytime-hang-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Bomba Schnitzel"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Golden, crunchy, and aggressively satisfying. The bomba brings heat and acidity, which keeps it from feeling too heavy."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://file.notion.so/f/f/b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5/7e93b398-91b6-4896-b2c0-0b78fd194ca4/DSCF3676.jpg?table=block&id=319c3484-e8de-809a-98f9-f62c4fa571c4&spaceId=b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5&expirationTimestamp=1783512000000&signature=bcAf5oik4lbL2rC2aXPli-GcSMMcIe0GgQqjspM19Y8",
      "caption": null,
      "localPath": "src/assets/images/reviews/mckiernan-brunch-review-lachine-canal-s-big-lively-daytime-hang-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Honey Garlic Spare Ribs"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sticky, glossy, and built for sharing. Sweet up front, savory on the finish, and messy in the way that feels appropriate for a daytime feast."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://file.notion.so/f/f/b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5/d8b5d580-b715-42f5-9021-6003b28d15f6/DSCF3694.jpg?table=block&id=319c3484-e8de-8075-8b56-e0f066e4b683&spaceId=b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5&expirationTimestamp=1783512000000&signature=V00AjPD7rfZHjvrqj_I9_MVd_lDRptV8Nqzi_3Jiv7I",
      "caption": null,
      "localPath": "src/assets/images/reviews/mckiernan-brunch-review-lachine-canal-s-big-lively-daytime-hang-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Homemade Donuts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Warm, fluffy, and dangerously easy to keep eating “just one more.” Exactly the kind of sweet, shareable finish that fits a brunch-lunch hang."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://file.notion.so/f/f/b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5/ec22f098-9838-4a53-9301-d3b576ee555c/DSCF3700.jpg?table=block&id=319c3484-e8de-806c-a40c-ed2948b8d7df&spaceId=b6fc3484-e8de-81e3-b238-00031f3692d5&expirationTimestamp=1783512000000&signature=dDzh1-MNKRW868sI0RuRNeY_OKuCmP77jhDN1gaY2As",
      "caption": null,
      "localPath": "src/assets/images/reviews/mckiernan-brunch-review-lachine-canal-s-big-lively-daytime-hang-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**If you’re sharing:** 2–3 plates total is the sweet spot for two people."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**What I’d do differently next time:** Keep it tighter at brunch. The room tempts you into ordering like you’re settling in for a long meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Coffee + Brunch Drinks"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This is not the moment for a complicated strategy. It’s a coffee place first."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**What to get:**"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "**Americano or drip coffee**",
        "**Espresso-based drink** if you want a little “dessert energy” without ordering dessert",
        "**One brunch cocktail** if you’re making a slow day of it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Service and Pacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Service is friendly and unpretentious. Pacing felt smooth, which is exactly what you want at brunch: steady plates, zero stress."
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Real Cost"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Per Person:** $30–55 (coffee + a couple plates, depending on how hard you go)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Lighter Option:** $20–35 (coffee + one main)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Worth It?** Yes. You’re paying for the room, the canal-side location, and solid, comforting cooking."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Save Money:** Skip cocktails, share plates, do coffee + one main each"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Before/After Dating Spots Nearby (Dating Concept)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This is the easiest place to turn brunch into a full daytime date."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Before (pick one):**"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Atwater Market (coffee, snacks, quick browse)",
        "Lachine Canal walk or bike (show up hungry)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**After (pick one):**"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Lachine Canal walk (the classic post-brunch reset)",
        "Picnic moment by the water (grab something small and keep it simple)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Booking & Timing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Best Time:** Weekend brunch, or a late lunch that turns into a canal walk"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Reserve:** Recommended on weekends"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Walk-Ins:** Possible, but it fills up fast on sunny days"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Daytime Date Fit"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**First Date:** 4/5 — Brunch makes conversation easy and low-pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Catch-up with friends:** 5/5 — Big room, good pacing, everyone leaves happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Impressing out-of-towners:** 4/5 — Very “Montreal” in the best way."
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Bottom Line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Overall: 8/10 (for brunch)**"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "McKiernan is a strong daytime pick: coffee first, a couple shareable plates, and then a walk along the canal. Go hungry, but do not get carried away ordering like it’s a feast."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Go Here If:** You want bright, lively brunch-lunch energy and comfort food that lands."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Skip If:** You want something tiny, quiet, and whisper-level."
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "icon": "✓",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Quick Reference:**"
    },
