        "**Where:** Sud-Ouest, by the Lachine Canal",
        "**Best Time:** Weekend brunch",
        "**Order:** Coffee + bread + one seasonal veg + one hearty main",
        "**Budget:** $30–55 per person",
        "**Rating:** 8/10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Details"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Address:** 5524 Rue Saint-Patrick, Montréal, QC H4E 1A8 (Suite 200)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
