    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Hours:** Mon–Fri 11:00am–10:30pm; Sat–Sun 10:00am–10:30pm (brunch until 3:00pm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Website:** [https://www.mckiernanmtl.com/](https://www.mckiernanmtl.com/)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Transit/Parking:** Best by bike or rideshare; street parking varies"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Dietary:** Ask about current menu; there are usually vegetarian-friendly small plates"
    }
  ],
